.* WRKJRNA: a journal's attributes, its receiver directory (F15) and
.* the objects it journals (F14). No golden: the pub400 account owns
.* no journal (title and keys).
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STAMPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 19'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=JRN CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JRNLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ATTRCV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ATTRCVLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JRNTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=ASP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=JRNSTATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MSGQLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MNGRCV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLTRCV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJCOUNT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=RCV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RCVLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RCVSTS CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RCVATT CLASS=STAMPCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=IMAGES CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OMTJRNE CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=RCVS VARS='OPT RCV RCVLIB RCVSTS RCVATT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE IMAGES OMTJRNE'.
:KEYL NAME=JAKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='RETURN 14'.F14=Display journaled objects
:KEYI KEY=F15 ACTION='RETURN 15'.F15=Work with receiver directory
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=SUBKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJRNA KEYL=JAKEYS HELP=WRKJRNA ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Journal Attributes
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATAI VAR=JRN USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal
:DATAI VAR=ATTRCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Attached receiver
:DATAI VAR=JRNTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:DATAI VAR=ASP USAGE=OUTPUT.ASP
:DATAI VAR=MSGQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Message queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=MSGQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=OBJCOUNT USAGE=OUTPUT.Journaled objects
:DATACOL WIDTH=38.
:DATAI VAR=JRNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI VAR=ATTRCVLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=JRNSTATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal state
:DATAI VAR=MNGRCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Manage receivers
:DATAI VAR=DLTRCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Delete receivers
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJRNRD KEYL=SUBKEYS HELP=WRKJRNRD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Receiver Directory
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JRN USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal
:DATAIX VAR=JRNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Library
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RCVS.(No receivers)
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD ?DLTJRNRCV JRNRCV(&RCVLIB./&RCV.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD DSPJRNRCVA JRNRCV(&RCVLIB./&RCV.)'.8=Display attributes
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Receiver
:LISTCOL VAR=RCVLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=RCVSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RCVATT USAGE=OUTPUT.Attached
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJRNOBJ KEYL=SUBKEYS HELP=DSPJRNOBJ ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Journaled Objects
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JRN USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal
:DATAIX VAR=JRNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Library
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS.(No objects are journaled)
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=IMAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Images
:LISTCOL VAR=OMTJRNE USAGE=OUTPUT.Omit
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKJRNA.Work with Journal Attributes - Help
:P.How a journal is set up: the receiver it writes to now, who hears
about it and how receivers are managed. F15 lists its receivers, F14
the objects it journals.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKJRNRD.Work with Receiver Directory - Help
:P.Every receiver chained to the journal, oldest first, with the time
it was attached. Option 8 shows a receiver's attributes.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPJRNOBJ.Display Journaled Objects - Help
:P.The objects whose changes the journal records, with the images it
keeps and the entries it leaves out.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
